      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, avatars upload slowly today, load slowly ingame too. Must be the aws servers as thats where the assets come from. But it can't be as all aws clients are treated equally there, right @{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
